    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture. The test has these understandability issues:\n1. `INSTANCE` initialization is a dense one-liner\n2. Many orphaned `data_*` methods are present with no `@ParameterizedTest` in this class referencing them\n3. Unnecessary imports for the removed dead code\n4. The test method itself could be clearer with named variables\n\nLet me write the improved test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version improves understandability by: splitting the `INSTANCE` builder chain across multiple lines, removing the seven orphaned `data_*` methods that had no corresponding `@ParameterizedTest` in this class, trimming unused imports to just the four actually needed, renaming the local variable to `accountingDate` for clarity, and adding a brief comment explaining the ISO-date equivalence being asserted."
